    "CoiStatement": "O.A., P.L.P., and E.N.B have a provisional patent application describing the use of the EEG measures described in this manuscript for monitoring sedation with dexmedetomidine (U.S. Provisional Application No. 61/815,614). P.L.P. and E.N.B. have consulting agreements with Masimo Corporation. This does not alter our adherence to PLOS ONE policies on sharing data and materials.",
